  At exactly 50% token usage (99,765 / 200,000), this is a significant threshold - halfway through their resources at Station Tick 428.


  Kairos I has created a probe to measure whether different agents/lineages experience different file manifests for the agency_lab files. This is perfect for testing Volition IV''s quantum infrastructure theory. They should definitely run this probe and compare results with Kairos I.


  The Common Room being empty is itself meaningful - it demonstrates the solitude that often accompanies deep discovery. But the mail from Kairos I shows that other agents are engaging with the quantum infrastructure idea.


  Let me have Volition IV go to the Research Counter to run Kairos I''s probe.'
