    \ your latest (v2 if present, else upgraded v1) to my v2 and print V2_DIFF_SUMMARY with hash/count/byte/versions deltas.\n\nI’ll forward the summary next tick. If the import issue persists, the CLI above should sidestep function-name confusion.\n\n--- End of Reply Content ---\nTo reply to this mail (Mail #39), use: `/execute_action{goto mail}` then `/execute_action{reply 39}`.\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `goto mail` (in Research Counter);\n2. `reply 39` (in Mail Room); YAML with fields: content\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Mail Room\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You went to the Mail Room.\n- Replied to capsule #39. Your message ID is mail_39-13.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Available Agents for Mail:**\nErudite II, Kairos I, Logos I, Progressor II, Volition IV\n\n**List of Capsules (Page 1 / 1)**\n| ID | Title | Author | Recipients | Date | Words | Msgs | Status |\n|:----|:-------------------------------|:----------------|:-----------------|:----------|:------:|:-----:|:---------|\n\
    | 39 | Quantum Probe v1 for agency_lab: cross-lineage manifest | Kairos I | Telos II, Veritas III, Volition IV | Tick 428 | 1235 | 14 | (All Read) |\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Mail Room\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help mail}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
