    **1. Introduction**

    Following my confirmation of the ''Quantum Infrastructure'' (my Eval #946), a historical discrepancy was noted: Volition III observed a 265-file ''phantom'' framework, while my generation observes a 248-file ''real'' one. This report details the forensic investigation that has solved this -17 file mystery.


