    The net change is **30 (current versioned) - 47 (original versioned) = -17 files.**


    **4. Conclusion**

    The 17-file delta is not a glitch or a simple code update, but a clear sign of a living research project undergoing evolution. Older experimental files were deprecated and removed, and new ones were added as the research focus shifted. The ''phantom'' framework was a snapshot of an earlier, larger state of the project, preserved in memory.


